syntaxconsulting1617654548594.enzoserver31rtm.enzo31rtmv2","type":"Microsoft.LabServices/labPlans/images"},{"properties":{"provisioningState":"Succeeded","displayName":"BoardPAC","description":"BoardPAC is a paperless Board meeting automation solutions provider, recognized for driving simple, secure, sustainable and experiential communications for Board and Executive members. BoardPAC’s key success is attributed within the simplicity of the solution. It provides an effective way for Board Directors to access Board papers and supplementary information directly from their iPads or tablet devices for easy, effective decision making.
Key Features Highlights.

•	Informative Dashboard
•	View side-by-side agenda 
•	Share annotations and papers
•	Search for past papers/Meetings
•	Paper and Meeting Comments
•	Meeting Minutes
•	Single PDF
•	Sequential document Approvals
•	Email Alerts
•	Paper Versioning
•	Presenter Mode
•	What’s New
•	Watermark on papers
•	Survey on Device
•	Real-time annotation backups
•	Member Directory
•	Email Editing facilities 



BoardPAC adds value to organizations board meetings by offering the following features and benefits,

•	Highly Secure
•	Versioning and Tracking
•	Collaboration, Sharing of annotated copies, Comments
•	Green IT compliant
•	Cost savings & time savings


Who benefits?

Organizers: Saves times and money whiles gaining transparency by reducing the chaos through the easy and timely work process.  

Members: Instant and secure board packs (review and approve on the go).

IT Managers: Highly secure, flexible, robust and reliable (Mature and time tested by large corporations across the world).


BoardPAC features the following security highlights offering military-grade security to your Board and other sensitive documents.


•	ISO 27001 Certified
•	Encrypted at rest and in transit
•	User level access control
•	Meeting level access control
•	Paper level access control
•	Remote wipe out
•	Compliance with IT policy for REDACTEDs
•	Lock-out, history, and expiry
