en2)","description":"<p>Ubuntu Minimal 24.04 LTS provides a minimal starting point, so application builders can install just the packages they need and minimize resource usage and security cross-section. Ubuntu Minimal images have a greatly reduced default package set, without many convenience tools for interactive usage. They are much smaller, boot faster, and will require fewer security updates over time since they have fewer packages installed. This plan is ideal for developers and operations teams who require a lightweight environment that minimizes resource use while providing the flexibility to customize the installation as needed. Despite its reduced size, it retains the capability to scale up by adding exactly the packages you require, making it particularly suitable for cloud applications and microservices that benefit from a minimalist approach.</p>","iconUrl":"https://store-images.s-microsoft.com/image/apps.58881.d6b8be3d-8460-4787-861d-21cf1c7d8331.825d4ccb-14d8-4418-b35c-6d8c6a8e3f82.e22e1dca-6a84-4c6d-9be0-04af63411a52","author":"Canonical","osType":"Linux","plan":"minimal","termsStatus":"Enabled","offer":"ubuntu-24_04-lts","publisher":"canonical","sku":"minimal","version":"latest","osState":"Generalized"},"id":"/subscriptions/2d5eedc9-8509-41fe-aac8-f16d54583ac6/resourceGroups/powershell-sdk-testing/providers/Microsoft.LabServices/labPlans/labplan-record-powershell/images/canonical.ubuntu-24_04-lts.minimal","name":"canonical.ubuntu-24_04-lts.minimal","type":"Microsoft.LabServices/labPlans/images"},{"properties":{"provisioningState":"Succeeded","displayName":"Ubuntu Minimal 24.04 LTS (Gen2)","description":"<p>Ubuntu Minimal 24.04 LTS provides a minimal starting point, so application builders can install just the packages they need and minimize resource usage and security cross-section. Ubuntu Minimal images have a greatly reduced default package set, without many convenience tools for interactive usage. They are much smaller, boot faster, and will requ